.TH SDL_TouchID 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_TouchID \- A unique ID for a touch device.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_touch.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef Uint64 SDL_TouchID;
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This ID is valid for the time the device is connected to the system, and is never reused for the lifetime of the application\[char46]
.PP
The value 0 is an invalid ID\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

